sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Server frame execution
    accDescr: The server updates retained state and viewport work before the RD compositor submits the frame. GPU completion is separate from CPU notifications.
    participant Main
    participant Server as RenderingServerDefault
    participant Scene as Scene and canvas cullers
    participant Particles
    participant VP as RendererViewport
    participant Comp as RD compositor
    participant RD as RenderingDevice
    Main->>Server: sync
    Main->>Server: draw
    Server->>Comp: begin_frame
    Server->>Scene: update scene then canvas
    Server->>Particles: update_particles
    Server->>Scene: render_probes
    Server->>VP: draw_viewports
    VP->>Scene: Render camera and canvas inputs
    VP->>Comp: Blit window outputs when requested
    Server->>Comp: end_frame
    Comp->>RD: swap_buffers
    RD->>RD: End graph and execute queues
    RD->>RD: Reuse next frame slot after completion
    Server->>Server: Visibility and post-draw notifications
